{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやほんとにつまらないかもしれない\n文字たんまりだし、なんかなんか\nハードル上がってるし！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅはハードル上げた覚え\nありまへんで！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もーやめてや本当...\nもう嫌やねん......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蚊！！！！！！ずーん\nかゆいねーん！ずん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん、せっかくにゃんとの写真なのに\n前髪ながいとき～(´･-･`)\nまた切って、ちゃんと載っけるね♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしっ、優里ブログのななみんと\n優里の写真をみてワナワナしつつ、笑\n答いむ答いむ＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りの顔文字は？(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだな～\nいろいろ使うけど、よく使うのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼(^o^)／ (´｡･ω･｡`) ´っω･* (´･-･`)\n(´×ω×`) (´∵｀) U｡･ｪ･｡Uﾉ (´・ω・｀)\nヽ(^ω^)ﾉ (*^o^*) (´;ω;`) (*/ω＼*) (**)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ...結構おおかった？いっぱい！笑\nこんなもんにしとくー！どぞ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋の握手会ではエセ名古屋弁\n使うのか？www"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっくそ...わたしとしたことが......\n名古屋弁、勉強します。らりんと笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーー、やぱあしゅりんのこと\n好きだわ...愛してもいいかな⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほ、ほほ...(*/ω＼*)照れ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいです！\nあしゅも好きー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"I LOVE 茎わかめ！！！ずん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すいません嘘です本当に嬉しいんです\nありがとうございます///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラス合唱で男子だけのクラスが\nぐるぐるカーテン歌って踊るのは\nありですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにそれすごい嬉しい(*^_^*)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、でも...\n大変申し上げにくいのですが、\n男子禁制となっておりますので\nちょっとな......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて言うと思ったかーーーふははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくみに行きたいけど、\n想像で我慢します(>_<)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度またディズニーシー行ったら\nちゃんと耳つけてくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんねー、ほんとはねーお耳 買って\nつけようとしたんよー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅに耳つけてほしかった\nっていうコメント結構あったから\n今度いったときは、つけますね♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だが写真は載せない！！！ずーん\n嘘だよちゃんと載せるってば～笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんは何の曲をよく聴くん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだのイヤホンしてる写真、\nなに聴いてたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー、最近はアイドルさんと\nSEKAI NO OWARIさんflumpoolさんを\nずーっと聴いてます♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも基本は何でも聴きます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにかオヌヌメの曲あったら\n教えてくださーいヽ(^ω^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーディション映像(乃木どこ)\n髪めっさ明るかったやん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、あの映像は多分ライトの感じで\nすごい明るく見えたんだと思います＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段も若干茶色いですけど、\n染めたことは無いですよー(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのー、フライバード団に仲間入り\nしたいんですけどいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フライバード団ってなんやねーん\nて、つっこんだらおkですか？にやっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フライバードなう！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅの専属家庭教師になりたいわ\nパフェ３個あげるのでどうですか？w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え、パフェ３個くれるってこと⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家庭教師もしてくれて、\nパフェもくれるの⁇笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえーいはっびーあしゅりーん♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今かわいいを くぁわいいと\n打ち間違えたけど、何かよくない？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おんどりゃあぁぁぁ!!!(とりゃあの\n進化系)使っていいよ(^^)b笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ、わあお...笑\nどっちも素敵ー！！☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使わせていただきますm(._.)m笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねーあしゅ、しょこたんすき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しくないけどすきだおヽ(^ω^)ﾉ\nかわゆすなあ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ところで「ジャスミン」ってなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、まあやのやつですね～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確かオーディションのときか\n乃木坂が結成されてから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅがジャスミン茶を\nよく飲んでたんです＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら「ジャスミン」って\n呼ばれるようになったよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう話。笑\nあ、あははは........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきなりだけど、タバコやめた方が\nいいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～そうですねえ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり体に良くないから\nやめた方がいいってのはありますけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな簡単にやめれるものでも\nないですよね(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱり健康第一！！\n出来るだけ控えた方がいいですね＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張りましょう(p`･ω･´q)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今.大学１回生なんですけど年の差は\n気にしますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全く！！！！ずん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気にする方が気にする！\n...あれ？どういう意味だー⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまり、全っ然気にしませんよ\nっていうことですU｡･ｪ･｡Uﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ族、みさみさーくる、\nひめきゅんさん、まい民 みたいに\nあしゅファンには名前あるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それ！それなんですけど、最近\nいろんなメンバーが募集して決めてる\nじゃないですか(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅも欲しいなー...\nなんて思っておりまして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしよければ、あしゅもみなさんに\nかんがえていただきたいです＊°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします(*｣´ｪ｀)｣♡ふへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで！少ない？多い？\n明日も続くかも～(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、お誕生日プレゼント\n受け取りました～(´｡･ω･｡`)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかこんなにたくさん届いてると\n思わなかった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"届けてくださった方の名前と物(ぶつ)\nを１こ１こ紙に書いたんですけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、文字にすると、\nより多くみえるんです！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今から使えそうなものは\nすぐ使っちゃう( • ̀ω•́  )✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、やっぱお誕生日が夏だったので\n夏物が多かったんですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう秋になっちゃった？から、\nそれは来年の夏つかう事にしました＊*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあまだ暑い日もありそうだから\n使えたら使うけどね～(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくすごく嬉しいです///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/07/8322268/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまね、ななみのこと嫌いなの。笑\nあの写真..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べ、べつに嫉妬なんてしてないよ？焦\nヤキモチなんてやいてない、よ？汗汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばーかばーか(´｡･ω･｡`)ふーんだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪きってきた。\nんちゃっっ"}],"source":"archive"}